{"seq":2,"slug":"ready-check-countdown","title":"准备确认与倒计时：Ready Check、地图投票与同步倒计时","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-multiplayer-lobby/features/ready-check-countdown","wordCount":1055,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"准备确认与倒计时-ready-check-地图投票与同步倒计时\">准备确认与倒计时：Ready Check、地图投票与同步倒计时</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>All Required</strong></td>\n<td>所有玩家必须主动确认准备才能开始；一人不准备则超时取消</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Timeout-Start</strong></td>\n<td>超时后踢出未准备玩家，剩余已准备玩家继续开局</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>地图投票</strong></td>\n<td>STARTING 阶段并行进行的候选地图投票，不延迟倒计时主流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>同步倒计时</strong></td>\n<td>服务端广播带时间戳的倒计时，客户端基于时间差渲染，消除网络延迟影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>宽限期踢出</strong></td>\n<td>超时不立即清理，给短暂延迟玩家缓冲，避免误踢</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"准备确认的设计目标\">准备确认的设计目标</h2><p>准备确认（Ready Check）是大厅向对局过渡的关键门控：确保所有玩家都在线且明确同意开始游戏，避免对局开始后才发现有人已经离开或 AFK。</p>\n<p>设计一个好的 Ready Check 需要平衡三个目标：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>快速</strong>：不让准备好的玩家等待太久</li>\n<li><strong>公平</strong>：给所有玩家足够的响应时间</li>\n<li><strong>不浪费</strong>：避免有人故意不准备拖延对局</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"all-or-timeout-语义\">All-or-Timeout 语义</h2><p>Ready Check 有两种基本语义：</p>\n<h3 id=\"all-required-所有人必须准备\">All Required（所有人必须准备）</h3><p>所有玩家都按下&quot;准备&quot;按钮后，立即开始游戏流程。等待超时（如 60 秒）后，若仍有人未准备，触发超时处理。</p>\n<p><strong>优点</strong>：确保每个进入对局的玩家都是有意愿的。</p>\n<p><strong>缺点</strong>：一个故意拖延的玩家可以阻止整个房间开始。</p>\n<p><strong>适用场景</strong>：竞技排位（绝不强行开始）、自定义房间。</p>\n<h3 id=\"timeout-start-超时后自动开始\">Timeout-Start（超时后自动开始）</h3><p>超时后，未准备的玩家被踢出（或标记为 AFK），剩余已准备的玩家继续开始游戏（如果仍满足最低人数要求）。</p>\n<p><strong>优点</strong>：不被少数人拖延；玩家体验更流畅。</p>\n<p><strong>缺点</strong>：可能把真正网络卡顿的玩家踢出（可配合宽限期缓解）。</p>\n<p><strong>适用场景</strong>：休闲对战、匹配系统自动凑局（玩家不一定认识）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"实现-ready-check-状态机\">实现：Ready Check 状态机</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"type ReadyCheckState struct {&#10;    ReadyPlayers   map[string]time.Time // PlayerID → 准备时间&#10;    TotalPlayers   int&#10;    Timeout        time.Duration&#10;    StartedAt      time.Time&#10;    Timer          *time.Timer&#10;    Policy         ReadyCheckPolicy // AllRequired / TimeoutStart&#10;}&#10;&#10;type ReadyCheckPolicy struct {&#10;    Type            string        // &quot;all_required&quot; / &quot;timeout_start&quot;&#10;    TimeoutDuration time.Duration // 准备超时时间&#10;    GracePeriod     time.Duration // 超时后踢出前的宽限期&#10;    MinPlayersToStart int         // TimeoutStart 模式下最少需要的已准备玩家数&#10;}&#10;&#10;func (rc *ReadyCheckState) markReady(playerID string) (bool, error) {&#10;    if _, exists := rc.ReadyPlayers[playerID]; exists {&#10;        return false, ErrAlreadyReady&#10;    }&#10;    rc.ReadyPlayers[playerID] = time.Now()&#10;&#10;    allReady := len(rc.ReadyPlayers) == rc.TotalPlayers&#10;    return allReady, nil&#10;}&#10;&#10;func (rc *ReadyCheckState) handleTimeout(room *RoomActor) {&#10;    notReadyPlayers := rc.getNotReadyPlayers()&#10;&#10;    switch rc.Policy.Type {&#10;    case &quot;all_required&quot;:&#10;        // 取消开始，广播超时通知，返回 WAITING 状态&#10;        room.broadcast(ReadyCheckFailedEvent{NotReady: notReadyPlayers})&#10;        room.transition(RoomStateWaiting, &quot;ready_check_timeout&quot;)&#10;&#10;    case &quot;timeout_start&quot;:&#10;        // 踢出未准备玩家&#10;        for _, playerID := range notReadyPlayers {&#10;            room.kickPlayer(playerID, KickReasonNotReady)&#10;        }&#10;        // 检查剩余玩家是否满足最低人数&#10;        remaining := rc.TotalPlayers - len(notReadyPlayers)&#10;        if remaining &gt;= rc.Policy.MinPlayersToStart {&#10;            room.transition(RoomStateInProgress, &quot;timeout_start_with_ready_players&quot;)&#10;        } else {&#10;            room.broadcast(ReadyCheckFailedEvent{Reason: &quot;insufficient_players&quot;})&#10;            room.transition(RoomStateWaiting, &quot;insufficient_players_after_kick&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadyCheckState</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ReadyPlayers   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Time</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // PlayerID → 准备时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    TotalPlayers   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Timeout        </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Duration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    StartedAt      </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Timer          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Timer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Policy         </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ReadyCheckPolicy</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // AllRequired / TimeoutStart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadyCheckPolicy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Type            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // \"all_required\" / \"timeout_start\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    TimeoutDuration </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Duration</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 准备超时时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    GracePeriod     </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Duration</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 超时后踢出前的宽限期</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    MinPlayersToStart </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         // TimeoutStart 模式下最少需要的已准备玩家数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">rc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ReadyCheckState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">markReady</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">playerID</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _, exists </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rc.ReadyPlayers[playerID]; exists {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ErrAlreadyReady</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rc.ReadyPlayers[playerID] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    allReady </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rc.ReadyPlayers) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rc.TotalPlayers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> allReady, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nil</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">rc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ReadyCheckState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">handleTimeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">room</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RoomActor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    notReadyPlayers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rc.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getNotReadyPlayers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    switch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rc.Policy.Type {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"all_required\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 取消开始，广播超时通知，返回 WAITING 状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        room.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">broadcast</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ReadyCheckFailedEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{NotReady: notReadyPlayers})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        room.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">transition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(RoomStateWaiting, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ready_check_timeout\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"timeout_start\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 踢出未准备玩家</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _, playerID </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> notReadyPlayers {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            room.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kickPlayer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(playerID, KickReasonNotReady)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 检查剩余玩家是否满足最低人数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        remaining </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rc.TotalPlayers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(notReadyPlayers)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> remaining </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rc.Policy.MinPlayersToStart {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            room.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">transition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(RoomStateInProgress, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"timeout_start_with_ready_players\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            room.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">broadcast</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ReadyCheckFailedEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{Reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"insufficient_players\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            room.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">transition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(RoomStateWaiting, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"insufficient_players_after_kick\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"地图投票-map-vote\">地图投票（Map Vote）</h2><p>地图投票在 STARTING 阶段进行，是准备确认流程的一部分（通常并行进行，不延迟倒计时）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"投票流程\">投票流程</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"进入 STARTING 状态&#10;    ↓&#10;抽取候选地图列表（通常 3 个）&#10;    ↓&#10;广播投票开始：{&quot;type&quot;: &quot;map_vote_started&quot;, &quot;candidates&quot;: [&quot;map_a&quot;, &quot;map_b&quot;, &quot;map_c&quot;], &quot;duration&quot;: 15}&#10;    ↓&#10;玩家在 15 秒内投票（每人一票，可弃权）&#10;    ↓&#10;倒计时结束（或所有人都投完）&#10;    ↓&#10;计票：得票最多的地图胜出；平局时随机选择&#10;    ↓&#10;广播结果：{&quot;type&quot;: &quot;map_vote_result&quot;, &quot;winner&quot;: &quot;map_a&quot;, &quot;votes&quot;: {...}}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>进入 STARTING 状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>抽取候选地图列表（通常 3 个）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>广播投票开始：{\"type\": \"map_vote_started\", \"candidates\": [\"map_a\", \"map_b\", \"map_c\"], \"duration\": 15}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>玩家在 15 秒内投票（每人一票，可弃权）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>倒计时结束（或所有人都投完）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>计票：得票最多的地图胜出；平局时随机选择</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ↓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>广播结果：{\"type\": \"map_vote_result\", \"winner\": \"map_a\", \"votes\": {...}}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"投票实现\">投票实现</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"type MapVote struct {&#10;    Candidates []string&#10;    Votes      map[string]string  // PlayerID → MapName&#10;    Abstained  map[string]bool    // PlayerID → true（弃权）&#10;    Deadline   time.Time&#10;    Result     string             // 投票结果（地图名）&#10;}&#10;&#10;func (mv *MapVote) castVote(playerID, mapName string) error {&#10;    if time.Now().After(mv.Deadline) {&#10;        return ErrVoteClosed&#10;    }&#10;    if !mv.isValidCandidate(mapName) {&#10;        return ErrInvalidMap&#10;    }&#10;    mv.Votes[playerID] = mapName&#10;    return nil&#10;}&#10;&#10;func (mv *MapVote) tally() string {&#10;    counts := make(map[string]int)&#10;    for _, mapName := range mv.Votes {&#10;        counts[mapName]++&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    maxVotes := 0&#10;    var leaders []string&#10;    for mapName, count := range counts {&#10;        if count &gt; maxVotes {&#10;            maxVotes = count&#10;            leaders = []string{mapName}&#10;        } else if count == maxVotes {&#10;            leaders = append(leaders, mapName)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 平局随机选&#10;    if len(leaders) == 0 {&#10;        return mv.Candidates[rand.Intn(len(mv.Candidates))] // 无人投票则随机&#10;    }&#10;    return leaders[rand.Intn(len(leaders))]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MapVote</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Candidates []</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Votes      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // PlayerID → MapName</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Abstained  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // PlayerID → true（弃权）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Deadline   </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Result     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">             // 投票结果（地图名）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">mv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">MapVote</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">castVote</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">playerID</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">mapName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">After</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mv.Deadline) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F9