\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> counts {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxVotes {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            maxVotes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            leaders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{mapName}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxVotes {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            leaders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(leaders, mapName)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 平局随机选</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(leaders) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mv.Candidates[rand.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Intn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mv.Candidates))] </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 无人投票则随机</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> leaders[rand.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Intn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(leaders))]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"同步倒计时\">同步倒计时</h2><p>倒计时（Countdown）是 STARTING 阶段的最终步骤：所有玩家准备完毕后，开始 5 秒（或 3 秒）倒计时，给玩家最后的视觉反馈。</p>\n<h3 id=\"倒计时同步的挑战\">倒计时同步的挑战</h3><p>倒计时看起来简单，但在分布式环境中有一个微妙的同步问题：不同玩家的网络延迟不同，如果服务端只发一条&quot;倒计时开始&quot;消息，各玩家看到的进度会不一致。</p>\n<p><strong>解决方案：基于服务端时间戳的客户端渲染</strong></p>\n<p>服务端广播倒计时时，附带服务端开始时间戳：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;type&quot;: &quot;countdown_started&quot;,&#10;  &quot;duration_ms&quot;: 5000,&#10;  &quot;server_start_ts&quot;: 1720000000000,&#10;  &quot;estimated_game_start_ts&quot;: 1720000005000&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"countdown_started\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"duration_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"server_start_ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1720000000000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"estimated_game_start_ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1720000005000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>客户端收到消息后：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>计算消息在网络中的传输延迟：<code>network_delay = local_now - server_start_ts</code>（假设服务端时间已同步）</li>\n<li>渲染已经过去的倒计时：从 <code>5000ms - network_delay</code> 开始展示</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这样所有玩家的倒计时进度与服务端保持对齐，差异在毫秒级（取决于网络延迟，通常 &lt; 100ms）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"倒计时中断\">倒计时中断</h3><p>倒计时中可能发生需要中断的事件：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>有玩家断线（心跳超时）</li>\n<li>服务器分配失败（Agones 返回错误）</li>\n<li>房主强制取消</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func (r *RoomActor) startCountdown(durationSec int) {&#10;    r.countdownTimer = time.AfterFunc(&#10;        time.Duration(durationSec)*time.Second,&#10;        func() {&#10;            r.inbox &lt;- Message{Type: MsgCountdownComplete}&#10;        },&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    r.broadcast(CountdownStartedEvent{&#10;        DurationMS:    int64(durationSec * 1000),&#10;        ServerStartTS: time.Now().UnixMilli(),&#10;    })&#10;}&#10;&#10;func (r *RoomActor) cancelCountdown(reason string) {&#10;    if r.countdownTimer != nil {&#10;        r.countdownTimer.Stop()&#10;        r.countdownTimer = nil&#10;    }&#10;    r.broadcast(CountdownCancelledEvent{Reason: reason})&#10;    r.transition(RoomStateWaiting, &quot;countdown_cancelled: &quot;+reason)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RoomActor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">startCountdown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">durationSec</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    r.countdownTimer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">AfterFunc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Duration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(durationSec)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">time.Second,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            r.inbox </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;-</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Message</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{Type: MsgCountdownComplete}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">broadcast</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">CountdownStartedEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        DurationMS:    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(durationSec </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ServerStartTS: time.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">UnixMilli</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RoomActor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cancelCountdown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">reason</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.countdownTimer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        r.countdownTimer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Stop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        r.countdownTimer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">broadcast</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">CountdownCancelledEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{Reason: reason})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    r.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">transition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(RoomStateWaiting, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"countdown_cancelled: \"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">reason)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"准备流程的完整时序\">准备流程的完整时序</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"房主点击&quot;开始游戏&quot;&#10;    → 服务端：RoomState WAITING → STARTING&#10;    → 广播：{&quot;type&quot;: &quot;ready_check_started&quot;, &quot;timeout&quot;: 60}&#10;&#10;玩家逐一点击&quot;准备&quot;&#10;    → 服务端更新 ReadyCheck 状态&#10;    → 广播：{&quot;type&quot;: &quot;player_ready&quot;, &quot;player_id&quot;: &quot;...&quot;, &quot;ready_count&quot;: 3, &quot;total&quot;: 5}&#10;&#10;地图投票（并行进行，15 秒）&#10;    → 广播候选地图 → 玩家投票 → 广播结果&#10;&#10;所有玩家准备完毕（或 Timeout-Start 超时踢出不准备玩家）&#10;    → 服务端：开始 5 秒倒计时&#10;    → 广播：{&quot;type&quot;: &quot;countdown_started&quot;, &quot;duration_ms&quot;: 5000, &quot;server_start_ts&quot;: ...}&#10;&#10;倒计时结束&#10;    → 服务端：GameServerAllocation（请求 Agones 分配服务器）&#10;    → 分配成功：RoomState STARTING → IN_PROGRESS&#10;    → 广播：{&quot;type&quot;: &quot;game_starting&quot;, &quot;server_ip&quot;: &quot;...&quot;, &quot;server_port&quot;: 7777, &quot;join_token&quot;: &quot;...&quot;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>房主点击\"开始游戏\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    → 服务端：RoomState WAITING → STARTING</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    → 广播：{\"type\": \"ready_check_started\", \"timeout\": 60}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>玩家逐一点击\"准备\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    → 服务端更新 ReadyCheck 状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    → 广播：{\"type\": \"player_ready\", \"player_id\": \"...\", \"ready_count\": 3, \"total\": 5}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>地图投票（并行进行，15 秒）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    → 广播候选地图 → 玩家投票 → 广播结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>所有玩家准备完毕（或 Timeout-Start 超时踢出不准备玩家）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    → 服务端：开始 5 秒倒计时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    → 广播：{\"type\": \"countdown_started\", \"duration_ms\": 5000, \"server_start_ts\": ...}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>倒计时结束</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    → 服务端：GameServerAllocation（请求 Agones 分配服务器）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    → 分配成功：RoomState STARTING → IN_PROGRESS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    → 广播：{\"type\": \"game_starting\", \"server_ip\": \"...\", \"server_port\": 7777, \"join_token\": \"...\"}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"准备流程状态图\">准备流程状态图</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; ReadyCheckStarted: 房主点击开始&#10;    ReadyCheckStarted --&gt; WaitingReady: 广播 ready_check_started&#10;    WaitingReady --&gt; WaitingReady: 玩家陆续准备&#10;    WaitingReady --&gt; MapVote: 所有人准备 / Timeout-Start&#10;    WaitingReady --&gt; Cancelled: 超时(All Required)&#10;&#10;    MapVote --&gt; Counting: 投票结束,选出地图&#10;    Counting --&gt; GameStarting: 5秒倒计时完成&#10;    GameStarting --&gt; [*]: 广播服务器地址&#10;&#10;    Cancelled --&gt; [*]: 返回 WAITING 状态\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; ReadyCheckStarted: 房主点击开始\n    ReadyCheckStarted --&gt; WaitingReady: 广播 ready_check_started\n    WaitingReady --&gt; WaitingReady: 玩家陆续准备\n    WaitingReady --&gt; MapVote: 所有人准备 / Timeout-Start\n    WaitingReady --&gt; Cancelled: 超时(All Required)\n\n    MapVote --&gt; Counting: 投票结束,选出地图\n    Counting --&gt; GameStarting: 5秒倒计时完成\n    GameStarting --&gt; [*]: 广播服务器地址\n\n    Cancelled --&gt; [*]: 返回 WAITING 状态</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>准备确认是大厅→对局的关键门控。策略选择取决于游戏类型：竞技排位用 All Required（绝不强行开始），休闲匹配用 Timeout-Start（流畅体验优先）。地图投票与 Ready Check 并行进行，不增加整体等待时间。同步倒计时的关键在于服务端广播时间戳而非纯粹的&quot;倒计时开始&quot;信号——客户端根据本地时间与服务端时间戳的差值渲染进度，确保所有玩家看到一致的倒计时画面。倒计时中断（断线/服务器分配失败）必须有明确的取消路径，避免玩家无限等待。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"准备确认与倒计时：Ready Check、地图投票与同步倒计时","id":"准备确认与倒计时-ready-check-地图投票与同步倒计时"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"准备确认的设计目标","id":"准备确认的设计目标"},{"level":2,"text":"All-or-Timeout 语义","id":"all-or-timeout-语义"},{"level":3,"text":"All Required（所有人必须准备）","id":"all-required-所有人必须准备"},{"level":3,"text":"Timeout-Start（超时后自动开始）","id":"timeout-start-超时后自动开始"},{"level":3,"text":"实现：Ready Check 状态机","id":"实现-ready-check-状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"地图投票（Map Vote）","id":"地图投票-map-vote"},{"level":3,"text":"投票流程","id":"投票流程"},{"level":3,"text":"投票实现","id":"投票实现"},{"level":2,"text":"同步倒计时","id":"同步倒计时"},{"level":3,"text":"倒计时同步的挑战","id":"倒计时同步的挑战"},{"level":3,"text":"倒计时中断","id":"倒计时中断"},{"level":3,"text":"准备流程的完整时序","id":"准备流程的完整时序"},{"level":2,"text":"准备流程状态图","id":"准备流程状态图"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"组队与邀请系统：Party、邀请码与跨平台支持","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-multiplayer-lobby/features/party-invite-system"},"next":{"title":"聊天与语音集成：WebSocket 消息协议、Vivox/Agora/WebRTC SFU","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-multiplayer-lobby/features/chat-voice-integration"}}